  "details": "Stage File Proxy is a general solution for getting production files on a development server on demand. **It is not intended for usage on production sites.**\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently check file URL for malicious content when attempting to do fallback retrieval leading to a cross-site scripting vulnerability.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact this development module must be enabled on an attacker's target site, and the attacker must be able to upload a malicious file to the \"origin\" server configured for the module.",
